Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.43,0:00:04.44,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Noctus Cochlear was the mastermind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:07.23,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,behind the unprecedented\Nchaos at the White Wolf's Den.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:09.06,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:12.76,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,the Association is holding a meeting\Nabout dealing with the aftermath.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:16.48,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Regarding the confiscated \Nitems from this incident...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:19.55,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Could we maybe get the Akasha golem?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.55,0:00:23.74,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,And the something-water? Those two things?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.01,0:00:28.39,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,By {\i1}water{\i0}, do you maybe \Nmean the Malice {\i1}Eater{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.39,0:00:30.50,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. That, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:32.94,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,What do you want with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.27,0:00:35.75,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,What would you need the Malice Eater for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.79,0:00:38.07,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.07,0:00:40.01,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,For drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.06,0:00:43.52,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,For drinking... you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:46.86,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Are you serious right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:49.78,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.02,0:00:54.14,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,We are now in the golden age \Nof the treasure hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.14,0:00:57.30,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Amid the sparkling talent on \Ndisplay in the capital of Zebrudia,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:01:00.04,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,there was one man who stood \Nout amongst all others!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:02.32,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,His name is Krai Andrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:04.81,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,This is an epic tale \Nfull of glory and agony,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.81,0:01:06.81,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,of how he became renowned \Nfor being the leader
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.81,0:01:09.27,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,of the strongest party he founded \Nwith his childhood friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.27,0:01:12.44,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,and also the master of the strongest clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.79,0:02:18.27,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Zebrudia's Association is just up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.27,0:02:19.53,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,Arnold!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.53,0:02:20.21,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.21,0:02:22.32,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,everybody will soon know the Falling Fog!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.53,0:02:25.54,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 10
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.53,0:02:25.54,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}I Want to Be Renowned in the Capital
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:25.11,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"I Want to Be Renowned in the Capital."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.21,0:02:44.01,Show Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,700)\pos(324,269)\fscx95\fscy76}Let This Grieving Soul Retire
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:02:58.14,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I knew asking you was the right move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:03:00.94,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I didn't get the golem, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.94,0:03:03.27,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,That's too bad, but c'est la vie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:06.76,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It's more than enough that \Nwe got something "to drink."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:11.67,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,That's getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.19,0:03:16.68,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I'll take care of the handover, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:19.18,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Sure. I'll wait for you in the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:20.32,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.80,0:03:25.68,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:29.13,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,do you have a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.17,0:03:32.18,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Crashing... Light...ning?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.41,0:03:36.30,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,The second name of Arnold Hail.\NHe recently came to the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.30,0:03:38.70,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,from Nebulanubes the Land of Fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.70,0:03:41.16,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,He's a level 7 hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:43.04,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,You really haven't heard of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:45.07,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm not interested in all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.07,0:03:47.67,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,You're pretty carefree, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.67,0:03:51.70,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,We're talking about a Dragon Slayer here— \Nsomeone who's taken down a thunder dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.70,0:03:55.34,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If you put it that way, \NI'm a Dragon Slayer, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.11,0:03:59.33,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.33,0:04:02.37,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Well, either way, please don't\Nstart trouble with him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.37,0:04:07.87,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,I'll be counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.30,0:04:11.38,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,There goes another Safety Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.35,0:04:16.03,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,But I will not yet leave this li-i-ife...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.03,0:04:16.65,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:19.72,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Is it already that time of year?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:24.12,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,The Zebrudian Auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:28.63,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,A grandiose event held once a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.82,0:04:31.80,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Most of the items auctioned are relics,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:32.61,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,so naturally,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:35.79,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,the quality and quantity of relics flowing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:38.41,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,into Zebrudia during this\Ntime are off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:42.47,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I completely forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.19,0:04:46.49,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I want to go, but I'm broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.49,0:04:48.96,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,If all else fails,\N I could borrow from Sitri...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.96,0:04:50.40,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.92,0:04:53.94,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Did I ever return what I \Nborrowed from her last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:57.34,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Krai, Krai, Krai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:00.54,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You are...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:01.87,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Chloe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.87,0:05:03.42,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Chloe Welter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:06.65,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,I'm usually over there at reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.65,0:05:07.84,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.84,0:05:08.66,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:10.53,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,She's Gark's niece.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.81,0:05:14.10,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Hard to believe they're related.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:16.43,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,My uncle's been in a really good mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.43,0:05:18.29,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.29,0:05:20.05,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.05,0:05:23.19,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,There was something about some \NDragon Slayer or whatnot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.19,0:05:24.55,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,You mean the Crashing Lightning?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.55,0:05:27.52,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,That's Arnold Hail, from the Falling Fog!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:29.04,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.04,0:05:31.30,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Almond Oil, from Fallin' Love.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:35.83,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting, Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:37.02,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:39.07,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:40.63,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:44.39,Internal,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,He's so dauntless...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:49.83,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So that's the Malice Eater?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.83,0:05:50.77,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.77,0:05:52.75,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,He's a very good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:00.57,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:02.11,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:04.84,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,You're new here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:06.79,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Welcome, and thank you for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.35,0:06:16.03,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It's pretty cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.03,0:06:18.82,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Isn't it dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.82,0:06:20.61,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Please don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.61,0:06:24.99,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I've trained it to not harm Krai or myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.35,0:06:27.55,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,I-Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.65,0:06:32.35,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,There, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.15,0:06:40.39,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Hey, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:44.63,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,You stop that, Drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:47.18,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,You mustn't bother Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.77,0:06:54.34,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Wait, you're really going to call it that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:57.71,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It's the name you gave him, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.71,0:07:00.19,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Not that I meant to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:03.87,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,She said that it wouldn't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.27,0:07:05.77,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,So what was that, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:08.67,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,That was just it snuggling up to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:12.23,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.23,0:07:17.08,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I need to charge my mana before \NDrink snuggles me to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.51,0:07:21.10,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Sitri, when is Lucia getting back again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.10,0:07:22.62,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Let me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:24.73,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It could be quite a while yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:28.81,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Actually, a strong swordsman phantom \Nappeared in the boss chamber...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.81,0:07:30.08,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:32.98,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So that disease of Luke's \Nflared up again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.98,0:07:34.05,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.36,0:07:37.30,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,He insisted on going at it alone\N until he can beat it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.30,0:07:40.80,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Lucia and the others said \Nthey'd stay as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:42.75,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:46.08,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I wish at least Lucia would come back...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:47.34,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:49.97,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I forgot to give this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:52.03,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,This.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:54.58,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.83,0:07:58.07,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What a classic Aspiration Manifest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.91,0:08:01.99,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,It's a relic that lets you \Nstore a single spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.99,0:08:07.46,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I always carry around the one \NLucia gave me as a lucky charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:09.38,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So what's up with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:10.82,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,You can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.82,0:08:13.84,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I hope you'll put it on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.71,0:08:16.88,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.89,0:08:19.52,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:23.41,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,That receptionist must have been blind!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.41,0:08:26.28,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,Arnold is level 7!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.28,0:08:27.73,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,It is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.73,0:08:30.65,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,We're the outsiders here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.65,0:08:31.67,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,Eigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.67,0:08:34.85,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Let's enlighten them as to just what we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.85,0:08:39.18,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,A hero from the Land of Fog is \Na hero in Zebrudia as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.18,0:08:42.25,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,We'll let these hunters \Nknow what we're made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:43.49,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.49,0:08:46.24,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,We're the Dragon Slayers of the Falling Fog!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.49,0:08:51.26,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,This is the last time anyone from \Nthis town looks down on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.56,0:08:56.09,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,You're itching to show off your \Nskills, right, Arnold?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.27,0:09:01.34,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.95,0:09:13.98,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Krai...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:17.89,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Does that feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.89,0:09:20.23,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yup, yup, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.61,0:09:23.79,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So, about charging my relics.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.79,0:09:26.19,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Most of them are out of mana,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:29.39,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,and I'd like to get them all \Ntopped up if possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.95,0:09:31.54,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,But since there are just so many,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.54,0:09:34.76,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'm reluctant to ask any \Nmage other than Lucia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.25,0:09:38.77,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,If that's so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:40.39,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,then I've got...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.28,0:09:45.83,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,a good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:50.84,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,All of you here right now are very lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:58.39,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Today, Krai suggested that we teach \Nyou a special mage-training technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:09:59.12,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:02.29,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,These lessons differ from his \Nusual Thousand Trials,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.29,0:10:04.41,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,so you need not fear death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.41,0:10:06.17,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,But there's much to gain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.17,0:10:09.91,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Those who do this will all be able \Nto become mages on par with Lucia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.18,0:10:11.97,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,On par with Lucia?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.97,0:10:15.17,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,There's a way to train to \Nget as powerful as her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:18.82,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,Count on Master to come \Nup with a plan like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.82,0:10:22.00,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,She's selling it well, but I \Nhave no idea what she's getting at.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.33,0:10:24.38,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,So, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:27.67,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Would anyone here be interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.72,0:10:34.45,Default,Lapis,0,0,0,,That is an intriguing offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.71,0:10:38.89,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Lapis. Kris.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.89,0:10:42.15,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I was not expecting members \Nof Starlight to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:47.06,Default,Kris,0,0,0,,What's with that look,\Nhonestly, feeble human?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.77,0:10:51.32,Default,Kris,0,0,0,,Lapis is here, and you don't\N even formally greet her, honestly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:10:53.34,Default,Kris,0,0,0,,Apologize properly, honestly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:55.16,Default,Lapis,0,0,0,,It's fine, Kris.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.16,0:10:57.86,Default,Lapis,0,0,0,,Dim-witted as he may be, \Nhe is the clan master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:11:01.52,Default,Lapis,0,0,0,,In human society, I suppose we \Nought to follow human customs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.81,0:11:08.87,Default,Kris,0,0,0,,It's really hard to believe that he's \NLucia's older brother, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.40,0:11:15.17,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Starlight is a unique party made of \Ndemi-humans called Noble Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.74,0:11:19.86,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Noble Spirits live for a long time \Nand are experts at magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:22.87,Sign,txt,0,0,0,,{\bord2\u1\fs20\pos(498.393,242.705)}Lapis Fulgor{\fs15\u0}\NHunter level 6
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.14,0:11:24.97,Top Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,but they casually look down on all \Nhumans who are not great mages.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.87,0:11:25.87,Sign,txt,0,0,0,,{\bord2\u1\fs20\pos(153.251,241.562)}Kris Argent{\fs15\u0}\NHunter level 3
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:28.86,Default,Lapis,0,0,0,,Well, then, Sitri Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:33.03,Default,Lapis,0,0,0,,Even for us Noble Spirits, Lucia \Nis someone special.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.03,0:11:35.63,Default,Lapis,0,0,0,,A human who overflows with magical talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:39.15,Default,Lapis,0,0,0,,Are you saying anyone can reach her level?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:41.96,Default,Lapis,0,0,0,,There is no training in this \Nworld that could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:45.34,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Lucia became the most\Nrenowned mage in the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.34,0:11:48.39,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,{\i1}because{\i0} of this training. Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.09,0:11:51.14,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:54.19,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,I'll try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:55.52,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.18,0:12:00.17,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,That's the spirit, Marietta.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:07.54,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,So I just need to charge it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:08.46,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.06,0:12:23.76,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,Hey, what is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.76,0:12:25.29,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,It's taking forever to charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:27.71,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Please keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.69,0:12:41.07,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:42.99,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Now for the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.99,0:12:43.82,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.15,0:12:45.31,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:58.57,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,The amount of mana a mage possesses\Ngreatly influences their skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:13:03.09,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,One can generally increase their mana\N from childhood to their mid-teens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.09,0:13:07.17,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Which means that everyone \Nhere is well past that stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.13,0:13:11.60,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,Marietta!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.61,0:13:15.16,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,Marietta?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:18.06,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,As you can see, if you overuse your mana,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.06,0:13:20.48,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,you reach this state of mana depletion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.48,0:13:23.60,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I'm sure all of you here have \Nexperienced this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.60,0:13:26.75,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,But! This moment is actually your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.11,0:13:29.92,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Since you've all reached the end \Nof your developmental stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.92,0:13:32.70,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,you can no longer increase \Nyour mana capacity normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.07,0:13:35.62,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,But that's no reason to despair!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:39.61,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It's a known fact that during recovery\N from a mana-depleted state,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.94,0:13:43.62,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,one's mana capacity also \Nincreases by a few percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:47.37,Default,Lapis,0,0,0,,An ultra-recovery, so to speak...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.37,0:13:51.51,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,But that requires you to abuse \Nyour mind to the absolute limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.51,0:13:55.80,Default,Kris,0,0,0,,Ridiculous! Even we need time to \Nrecover our mana, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.80,0:13:59.21,Default,Kris,0,0,0,,This is in no way an efficient \Nway to train, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.21,0:14:01.89,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,And that's where this comes in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.38,0:14:04.50,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,Hey, wai—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:18.15,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,And as you can see, Marietta's mana \Ncapacity has indeed increased!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.79,0:14:21.40,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,By repeating this process over and over,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.40,0:14:23.92,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,it becomes a viable way \Nto improve your abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.27,0:14:27.93,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Huh? Lucia's been doing that all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.93,0:14:31.04,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,No pain, no gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.04,0:14:33.55,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Surely you're aware of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.63,0:14:33.55,Top,Killiam,0,0,0,,Kill, kill, kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.86,0:14:36.82,Default,Lapis,0,0,0,,Lucia really became {\i1}that{\i0} strong \Nthrough this training?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.82,0:14:40.46,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,The power Lucia wields \Ndoesn't come from talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.36,0:14:45.44,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It's from all the blood, sweat, \Nand tears she's shed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.44,0:14:48.01,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,and from her mana capacity!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:53.82,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,And all the while she did this, she never \Nonce let it show that she was suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.09,0:15:00.34,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Speaking of, I've heard that \NStarlight wants to scout Lucia...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.61,0:15:05.23,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,But you're resting on your laurels for \Nbeing a race gifted with magic talent...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.74,0:15:10.54,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Perhaps that attitude is the reason \Nthat Lucia isn't impressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.83,0:15:13.00,Default,Kris,0,0,0,,That's so rude... honestly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:14.11,Default,Lapis,0,0,0,,Kris.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.11,0:15:17.48,Default,Lapis,0,0,0,,We will not stand idly by and \Nlet her humiliate us any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:18.73,Default,Kris,0,0,0,,Yes, honestly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.98,0:15:22.73,Default,Kris,0,0,0,,Hey. Give me those relics\Nright now, honestly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.03,0:15:27.01,Default,Kris,0,0,0,,I'm going to charge all \Nof them right away, honestly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.01,0:15:28.67,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Well, if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:31.49,Default,Killy,0,0,0,,Kill, kill, kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.18,0:15:33.36,Default,Killy,0,0,0,,Kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:36.29,Default,Lapis,0,0,0,,This is not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:38.34,Default,Lapis,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be a big deal, Kris.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.34,0:15:39.52,Default,Kris,0,0,0,,Yes, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.52,0:15:41.93,Default,Kris,0,0,0,,Here I go, honestly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:45.05,Default,Eena,0,0,0,,I-I'll do it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.05,0:15:46.37,Default,Yarwa,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.62,0:15:48.42,Default,Satsuma,0,0,0,,I won't be left in the dust!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.42,0:15:49.34,Default,Tsuzuite,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.34,0:15:50.33,Default,All,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.33,0:15:51.25,Default,All,0,0,0,,Same!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.38,0:15:57.40,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Looks like the relics will all get charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.40,0:15:59.89,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:05.44,Default,Nahum,0,0,0,,And have you given it some thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.44,0:16:08.71,Default,Nahum,0,0,0,,It's not a bad deal for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.93,0:16:11.75,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,I'm very honored,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.75,0:16:14.78,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,but there are still things I must learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.78,0:16:17.36,Default,Nahum,0,0,0,,You mean from Thousand Tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.36,0:16:20.51,Default,Nahum,0,0,0,,To think that there could be a \Nhunter that would rival you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.51,0:16:22.87,Default,Nahum,0,0,0,,you who hail from the House of Rodin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.30,0:16:25.00,Default,Nahum,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.00,0:16:29.13,Default,Nahum,0,0,0,,We can wait for the right time \Nto discuss our exclusivity deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.45,0:16:30.79,Default,Nahum,0,0,0,,Which reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.79,0:16:32.80,Default,Nahum,0,0,0,,Have you already met with Earl Gladis?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.04,0:16:33.92,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,Not yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.31,0:16:38.26,Default,Nahum,0,0,0,,Apparently, his daughter\Nhas been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:39.16,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.15,0:16:41.65,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,Lady Éclair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.18,0:16:50.08,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Please make yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.08,0:16:54.06,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,It will take some time for her to emerge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:16:57.50,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Ti.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:17:01.46,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,My sister is treating you \Nhorribly, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:06.32,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,Y-You're too close, Sitri.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.16,0:17:09.16,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,You'd become stronger much faster
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.16,0:17:12.22,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,if you left her and joined me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:15.50,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,M-Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.50,0:17:16.48,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Sitri.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:19.33,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I was just joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.25,0:17:22.33,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Ti? Where's my towel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.97,0:17:23.86,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:25.45,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I'm bringing it right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:27.49,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.49,0:17:29.38,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I told you to get it ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.89,0:17:30.89,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.89,0:17:32.40,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,It's Krai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.99,0:17:35.86,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Liz, put on some clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.34,0:17:35.28,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,Ouch... wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.28,0:17:36.99,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,Your fingers... my eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.86,0:17:37.73,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,You're going to make Krai uncomfortable!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.73,0:17:39.05,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.41,0:17:41.21,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,What? He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.46,0:17:42.13,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.16,0:17:44.41,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:48.04,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,What brings you over?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:49.06,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.06,0:17:52.49,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I was thinking we could celebrate you \Nand Sitri coming back home safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.74,0:17:56.25,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Oh, that's so nice of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.33,0:18:00.02,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,You stay away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:02.71,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Si, stop getting in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.71,0:18:04.34,Top,Sitri,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} need to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.09,0:18:04.57,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Tino, you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.57,0:18:07.34,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm invited, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:09.98,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,The more the merrier, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.28,0:18:10.60,Top,Sitri,0,0,0,,Apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.60,0:18:11.68,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.47,0:18:17.58,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,We're treated like country \Nbumpkins no matter where we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.58,0:18:19.03,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,How dare they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.85,0:18:22.22,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,They're such a snobby bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:23.17,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Eigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.77,0:18:26.26,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Is there anywhere to get \Na drink around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.82,0:18:29.55,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Si... you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.23,0:18:32.29,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You did something, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.77,0:18:36.83,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,There's no way I would get drunk this fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.83,0:18:38.80,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Please stop with the wild accusations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:40.74,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Right, Ti?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.74,0:18:43.92,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I... I didn't see anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.30,0:18:46.06,Default,MaruP,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:48.02,Top,MaruP,0,0,0,,Please enjoy your stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.79,0:18:48.57,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Already tapping out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:51.00,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Then I guess all of this will be your treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:51.93,Top,Guest,0,0,0,,MaruP, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:51.53,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.53,0:18:53.02,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Don't be so full of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:53.69,Top,MaruP,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:56.11,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I can see through all your schemes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.11,0:18:59.36,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I bet that whole Akashic \Nthing was all your doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:01.97,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,You're way too drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.97,0:19:04.79,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,That golem was totally useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.79,0:19:07.33,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,A little sturdy, but besides\Nthat, it was ultra-weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.57,0:19:10.42,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,That was because it hadn't been \Ntrained in real combat yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:13.34,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Once I improve it a few times, \Neven you won't be able to—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.34,0:19:15.46,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Krai, did you hear that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.46,0:19:17.10,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. I certainly did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.46,0:19:19.24,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Liz, I think you've had too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.82,0:19:22.62,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you on her side?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.49,0:19:26.88,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Let's resume our drinking contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:29.08,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Or you can tap out like a loser if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:30.54,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.54,0:19:32.51,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,And don't think you're going to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.97,0:19:35.82,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,You're so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.82,0:19:37.66,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,No fighting, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.72,0:19:42.20,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Sitri, I bet the weird\Naccusations don't feel great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:45.01,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,We can call this even now, right, Liz?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.25,0:19:46.47,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Here you go, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.47,0:19:48.68,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,H-Hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.90,0:19:48.45,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.29,0:19:54.51,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I drank it all. Now it's your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.51,0:19:56.79,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Go. Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.04,0:20:08.76,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Krai, aren't you just \Ntaking advantage of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.76,0:20:09.67,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.11,0:20:13.40,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,You only shee me as a wallet, don'tcha?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.40,0:20:16.54,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,D'you have any idea how \Nmuch money I've lent you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:19.48,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Ten digits. Ten digits!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.86,0:20:22.14,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. That's so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.14,0:20:24.38,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Wait, ten digits?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.38,0:20:29.32,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I'm going to have you pay \Nme back with your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.23,0:20:32.04,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:35.18,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Touching is forbidden!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:38.54,Default,Hunter,0,0,0,,What's your problem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.54,0:20:39.53,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.84,0:20:41.95,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,We are the Falling Fog!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.95,0:20:43.83,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,And don't you forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.83,0:20:46.12,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,And this is the hero of Land of Fog,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.12,0:20:48.05,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,the Dragon Slayer known \Nas Crashing Lightning,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.06,0:20:50.68,Sign,txt,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs15\pos(140.222,216.001)}"Crashing Lightning"\N{\u1\fs20}Arnold Hail{\fs15\u0}\NHunter level 7
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.61,0:20:50.38,Top,Eigh,0,0,0,,Arnold Hail!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.93,0:20:53.55,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,I'll enlighten you halfwits \Nhere in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.03,0:20:57.22,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Arnold is level 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.22,0:20:58.37,Default,Odoro,0,0,0,,Seven?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.37,0:20:59.06,Default,Kyoi,0,0,0,,Seven...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.57,0:21:04.45,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I wonder if I could build \Na new Killiam with that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.68,0:21:06.51,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Arnold?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:09.71,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I feel like I've heard that name before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.71,0:21:10.95,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Oh, well. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.95,0:21:13.17,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Hey, booze and women.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.17,0:21:16.04,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Got it! Bring us booze and women!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.04,0:21:17.55,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:20.63,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I've got booze and a woman right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.63,0:21:21.47,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:22.17,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.17,0:21:24.30,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Liz, that's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.30,0:21:25.80,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Early bird gets the worm!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.45,0:21:30.26,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You want to drink with \Na fine woman, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.63,0:21:33.84,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'll give you a special treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.55,0:21:36.24,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Go home, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.23,0:21:42.01,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Don't be like that. Just drink up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:47.24,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,And the beer stein, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.24,0:21:48.95,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.95,0:21:51.52,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat you \Nto a mushy, messy pulp!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:54.41,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.07,0:21:56.77,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You're so damn weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.77,0:21:59.23,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Are you really level 7?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:05.25,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.01,0:22:06.45,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Let's drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.96,0:22:10.25,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.25,0:22:12.47,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,This girl's had way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.98,0:22:14.51,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Come on, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.89,0:22:19.19,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Tino, Sitri. We're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.19,0:22:20.53,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:22.74,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Triumphantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.97,0:22:24.27,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. Looks like I forgot my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.74,0:22:25.68,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,the Falling Fog came to the capital \Nto make a name for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.27,0:22:25.97,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,Could I borrow some money?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.68,0:22:27.37,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,But look at them now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.37,0:22:29.09,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,What a sad state of affairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.54,0:22:33.54,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,The world is vast, Arnold Hail.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.54,0:22:37.92,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,You've got this next time, \Nour Dragon Slayer, Arnold Hail!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.92,0:22:39.11,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,All in the next episode!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.11,0:22:40.58,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Please tune in again next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.72,0:23:44.73,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\fs15\pos(515.016,354.111)}By: MaruP-chang
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.73,0:23:33.08,Top,MaruP,0,0,0,,A heavy blow to the head in the \Npub, what a shocking shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.08,0:23:35.88,Top,MaruP,0,0,0,,Enraged, she caught him unaware. \NHe's mad she got 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.88,0:23:37.81,Top,MaruP,0,0,0,,I bet they're really good hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.81,0:23:38.80,Top,MaruP,0,0,0,,Or maybe not?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.80,0:23:41.16,Top,MaruP,0,0,0,,Being treated like noobs and can't sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.16,0:23:42.64,Top,MaruP,0,0,0,,We hate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.64,0:23:45.08,Top,MaruP,0,0,0,,Next time on {\i1}Let This Grieving Soul Retire{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.73,0:23:50.02,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 11
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.73,0:23:50.02,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}The Falling Fog Wants Revenge
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.08,0:23:45.54,Internal,MaruP,0,0,0,,Retire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.54,0:23:47.50,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"The Falling Fog Wants Revenge."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.50,0:23:48.33,Default,MaruP,0,0,0,,Revenge!
